{"data":[{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-27T16:17:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1895146207347200297"],"id":"1895146207347200297","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":49620,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"细狗就是好拿捏，现在对门那边不是在做爱咿咿呀呀了，而是时不时传出细狗被骂的声音。真心希望他女朋友一气之下搬出房子。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1895146207347200297"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-27T15:39:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1895136766694481977"],"id":"1895136766694481977","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":48103,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"说时迟那时快，细狗的女朋友回来了😹","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1895136766694481977"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-27T15:31:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1895134584490336510"],"id":"1895134584490336510","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":52699,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今晚轮到我去敲他的门。。。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1895134584490336510"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-27T10:43:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1895062180355285453"],"id":"1895062180355285453","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":50207,"like_count":58,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"回家，今晚看我勾引对门的小细狗。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1895062180355285453"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-26T16:25:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1894785996098805790"],"id":"1894785996098805790","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":53732,"like_count":54,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都这个点了，你一个男的腰间只围了一条浴巾，然后敲门问我有没有吹风机。你还有女朋友在家里诶，你这不是太过分了吗？？？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1894785996098805790"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-02-25T17:00:22.000Z","edit_his